            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The rebellion is broken! In the name of King Garard and the royal scepter, I strike you down!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Arand",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "this_item.hitpoints",
                value: 9,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("King Garard?! My brother sent you? But I thought—? Wait, stop, please, I don’t understand!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 5,
            experience: "no",
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arand%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arand",
            primary_attack_name: "$last_weapon",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The young Prince Eldred told us how you tried to claim the throne for yourself, Arand. You are mortally wounded — confess now, and King Garard may forgive you in death."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("By the Sceptre, I swear I have never conspired against my brother Garard. Eldred is the traitor! Eldred and Asheviere are the traitors, not me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 1,
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arand%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arand",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("My life runs short; you must believe my tale. For some time now my spies have heard whispers of a terrible conspiracy, a plot to overthrow the very king himself. ’Twas not a fortnight hence that my suspicions were confirmed — I gained incontrovertible evidence proving the chief conspirators to be none other than the queen and the prince, two of my brother’s closest companions!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("Yet no sooner did this news arrive than my bodyguards and I were set upon by Eldred himself, so bold as to strike even during the day! I slew several of his fighters and grievously wounded the young prince, yet barely escaped to Fort Garard before my guards were overwhelmed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("And now it seems that Eldred has found a way to finish me off after all..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I sense the ring of truth in your words... But if what you say is true, why fight when we approached instead of surrender? To my eyes, your resistance only sealed your guilt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Malal. He is dead now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("But if you are here with me, then Eldred is alone with the king?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 3,
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arand%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arand",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 2,
            kill: "no",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arand%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arand",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arand",
            text: _("So much blood... please, you must believe me! Save my brother... save Wesnoth..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:harm_unit",
            amount: 999,
            kill: "yes",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Arand%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Arand",
